---
/**
 * Vendors section for Max ITC.
 */
---

<section id="vendors" class="bg-generic-00 py-16 md:py-20">
  <div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-[var(--container-max)] px-4 md:px-6">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 lg:gap-14 items-center">
      <!-- Left Column: Heading, Subtitle & CTA (CTA visible on lg+) -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-5 flex flex-col items-start gap-4 sm:gap-6">
        <h2 class="m-0 text-[length:var(--fs-h2)] md:text-[length:var(--fs-h1)] leading-[length:var(--lh-h2)] md:leading-[length:var(--lh-h1)] font-medium text-vault-navy font-heading">
          Why should your business suffer when your vendors do not comply?
        </h2>
        <p class="m-0 text-neutral-500 font-normal text-[length:var(--fs-body)] md:text-[length:var(--fs-body-lg)] leading-relaxed sm:leading-[length:var(--lh-body)] md:leading-[length:var(--lh-body-lg)] font-body max-w-[480px]">
          Sub-optimal input tax credit management can impact profitability by up
          to 8%.{" "}
          <span class="font-bold text-neutral-500">
            We think that is a lot.
          </span>
        </p>
        <!-- Desktop CTA -->
        <div class="hidden lg:block pt-1">
          <a
            href="https://www.cleartax.com/contact-us"
            data-demo-open
            class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 px-5 py-3.5 font-body rounded-lg font-medium text-nova-50 text-[length:var(--fs-label-lg)] leading-[length:var(--lh-label-lg)] cursor-pointer bg-nova-blue border border-nova-blue hover:bg-nova-50 hover:text-nova-blue transition-all duration-150 ease-in-out no-underline"
          >
            Book a Demo
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Right Column: 2 Stat Cards + Mobile CTA -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-7 flex flex-col gap-4 sm:gap-5">
        <!-- Card 1 -->
        <div class="border border-neutral-200 rounded-2xl bg-generic-00 p-5 sm:p-6">
          <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row divide-y sm:divide-y-0 sm:divide-x divide-neutral-200 gap-4 sm:gap-0">
            <!-- Left / Top Half -->
            <div class="pb-4 sm:pb-0 sm:w-[62%] sm:pr-8 flex flex-col justify-center">
              <span class="font-heading font-semibold text-vault-navy text-[length:var(--fs-h4)] leading-tight sm:leading-[length:var(--lh-h4)] mb-2 sm:mb-3">
                3-7 %
              </span>
              <h3 class="m-0 font-heading font-medium text-vault-navy text-[length:var(--fs-h6)] leading-snug sm:leading-[length:var(--lh-h6)] mb-2 sm:mb-3">
                VAT Recovery Risk for Your Buyers
              </h3>
              <p class="m-0 font-body text-neutral-500 text-[length:var(--fs-body)] leading-relaxed sm:leading-[length:var(--lh-body)]">
                Input Tax Credit was never filed in financial year 2019-2020 due
                to vendor non-compliance
              </p>
            </div>

            <!-- Right / Bottom Half -->
            <div class="pt-4 sm:pt-0 sm:w-[38%] sm:pl-8 flex flex-row items-center gap-2.5 sm:flex-col sm:justify-center sm:items-start">
              <span class="font-heading font-semibold text-nova-blue text-[length:var(--fs-h4)] leading-tight sm:leading-[length:var(--lh-h4)] sm:mb-3">
                6-8 %
              </span>
              <span class="font-heading font-medium text-vault-navy text-[length:var(--fs-h6)] leading-tight sm:leading-[length:var(--lh-h6)]">
                PBT impact
              </span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Card 2 -->
        <div class="border border-neutral-200 rounded-2xl bg-generic-00 p-5 sm:p-6">
          <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row divide-y sm:divide-y-0 sm:divide-x divide-neutral-200 gap-4 sm:gap-0">
            <!-- Left / Top Half -->
            <div class="pb-4 sm:pb-0 sm:w-[62%] sm:pr-8 flex flex-col justify-center">
              <span class="font-heading font-semibold text-vault-navy text-[length:var(--fs-h4)] leading-tight sm:leading-[length:var(--lh-h4)] mb-2 sm:mb-3">
                6-11 %
              </span>
              <p class="m-0 font-body text-neutral-500 text-[length:var(--fs-body)] leading-relaxed sm:leading-[length:var(--lh-body)]">
                Input Tax Credit was delayed due to delays in filing by vendors
                in financial year 2019-2020
              </p>
            </div>

            <!-- Right / Bottom Half -->
            <div class="pt-4 sm:pt-0 sm:w-[38%] sm:pl-8 flex flex-row items-center gap-2.5 sm:flex-col sm:justify-center sm:items-start">
              <span class="font-heading font-semibold text-nova-blue text-[length:var(--fs-h4)] leading-tight sm:leading-[length:var(--lh-h4)] sm:mb-3">
                5-7%
              </span>
              <span class="font-heading font-medium text-vault-navy text-[length:var(--fs-h6)] leading-tight sm:leading-[length:var(--lh-h6)]">
                working capital stuck
              </span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Mobile CTA (Rendered at bottom on mobile) -->
        <div class="block lg:hidden w-full pt-1">
          <a
            href="https://www.cleartax.com/contact-us"
            data-demo-open
            class="w-full flex items-center justify-center gap-2 px-5 py-3.5 font-body rounded-lg font-medium text-nova-50 text-[length:var(--fs-label-lg)] leading-[length:var(--lh-label-lg)] cursor-pointer bg-nova-blue border border-nova-blue hover:bg-nova-50 hover:text-nova-blue transition-all duration-150 ease-in-out no-underline"
          >
            Book a Demo
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
